Śārdūla tells Rāvaṇa Rāma camps on Suvēla --- Śārdūla describes beating by monkeys and rescue by Rāma --- Śārdūla warns Rāma stands armed at Laṅkā door --- Rāvaṇa refuses to return Sītā even from fear of all worlds --- Rāvaṇa asks the names and might of monkey chiefs --- Śārdūla names Jāmbavān and Suṣeṇa and Nīla and Hanumān --- Śārdūla names Aṅgada and Mainda and Dvivida and Nala --- Śārdūla praises Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa and notes Vibhīṣaṇa joined Rāma